{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forgotten Playland is an utterly chaotic party game where plush toys settle scores in an abandoned attic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and up to 3 friends become PlushKyn, squishy misfits who sprint, shove, spin, and shoot their way through a pile of ridiculous challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>20+ PARTY GAMES:</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840260/extras/143a56d859db64fd251d6168975ad92a.poster.avif?t=1772009556\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840260/extras/143a56d859db64fd251d6168975ad92a.webm?t=1772009556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840260/extras/143a56d859db64fd251d6168975ad92a.mp4?t=1772009556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce around on pogo sticks, blast each other with bombs, launch yourself at tin cans, dodge chomping teeth, tiptoe across invisible paths, and scramble for coins. Doing whatever it takes to mess with your friends just enough to steal the win.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ATTIC:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840260/extras/3aad99d01d3b2f906b90b28b16c0f2f8.poster.avif?t=1772009556\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840260/extras/3aad99d01d3b2f906b90b28b16c0f2f8.webm?t=1772009556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840260/extras/3aad99d01d3b2f906b90b28b16c0f2f8.mp4?t=1772009556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hang out in spots like the Space Disco, Jungle Camp, or Train Station = the perfect places to mess around with friends while you wait for the next round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840260/extras/ed572f9fd71c696968b0f6792f019bc6.poster.avif?t=1772009556\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840260/extras/ed572f9fd71c696968b0f6792f019bc6.webm?t=1772009556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840260/extras/ed572f9fd71c696968b0f6792f019bc6.mp4?t=1772009556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between all the chaos, the Attic turns into a busy playground for up to 32 players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOCIAL GAMES:</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840260/extras/1d59849532370cb63ff102a764a66ff8.poster.avif?t=1772009556\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840260/extras/1d59849532370cb63ff102a764a66ff8.webm?t=1772009556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840260/extras/1d59849532370cb63ff102a764a66ff8.mp4?t=1772009556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover smaller social games hidden around the Attic to play with friends and foes alike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR PLUSHKYN:</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840260/extras/baec994d8bec4b5f51280f55e51f8953.poster.avif?t=1772009556\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840260/extras/baec994d8bec4b5f51280f55e51f8953.webm?t=1772009556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840260/extras/baec994d8bec4b5f51280f55e51f8953.mp4?t=1772009556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your PlushKyn is yours to perfect\u2026 or ruin.\u2028</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match 10 different traits; skins, arms, legs, tail, and more. To build everything from adorable heroes to cuddly monsters, then show off your look in every match.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BOARD GAME:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the dice, move across a hand\u2011crafted board and use items to mess with other players... <i>but</i> watch out for snakes waiting to send you tumbling back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A LIVING WORLD:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forgotten Playland keeps growing with new games, cosmetics, and little surprises, turning this dusty room into a living Playland you can keep coming back to with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to explore, compete, and create memories in a world built by forgotten toys?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3840260?t=1772009556","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3840260?t=1772009556","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840260/9307ef812401d5b96e4e58a0afac5459036d577e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772009556","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840260/9307ef812401d5b96